# Public Committees & CNIC Verification Implementation Plan

Transform **Sanjhi** into a community-driven discovery platform by introducing a **Public Committee Marketplace** (allowing users to explore and join public savings pools) backed by **CNIC Identity Verification** (preventing default/fraud in open committees).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Compulsory CNIC Enforcement for Public Committees**:
> Users will be able to browse public committees freely, but **must complete CNIC verification** (CNIC number format `XXXXX-XXXXXXX-X` + uploading Front & Back photos) before submitting a join request for any public committee. Private committees (via invite codes) will remain accessible as usual.

> [!NOTE]
> **Admin CNIC Approval Workflow**:
> Submitted CNICs will be stored securely in `public/uploads/cnic/` and reviewed via the Admin Dashboard. Admin approval updates `cnic_status` to `'verified'`. Organizers will see a "CNIC Verified ✅" badge next to applicant names in join requests.

